itiraame","poem":1},{"text":"Eglippe yelides.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["Hayti usuppunati Dawiti Kebroonen laappun layththinne bagga deraa ayssiza wode yelettida; Dawiti Yerusalaamen 33 layth kawotides."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["Izi heen dishe yelida attuma nayti hayssafe kaalli dizayta; Am7eele naa Bersaabeha Shim7a, Shoobaabe, Naataanenne Solomoone geetettiza oyddu attuma nayta izas yeladus."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["Qasse hara uddufun attuma nayti izas deettes; heytikka Iyabeheere, Elsu7e, Elfaleexe"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Nogahe, Nefege, Naafiya,"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Elshama, El7aadanne Elfaleexe geetettizayta."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Heytappeka hara Dawiti garadetappe yelida attuma nayti deettes; isttaskka Ti7imaaro geetettiza michcha dawus."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Kawo Solomoone Nayta Zarkke"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Kawo Solonooney","poem":1},{"text":"Erobi7aame yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Erobi7aamey Abiya yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Abiyay Aasa yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Aasay Iyoosaafixe yelides;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyoosaafixey Iyoraame yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyoraamey Akaziyaasa yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Akaziyaasi Iyo7aasa yelides;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyo7aasi Amasiyaase yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Amasiyaasi Azaariyaase yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Azaariyaasi Iyo7aatame yelides;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyo7aatamey Akaaze yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Akaazey Hizqiyaasa yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hizqiyaasi Minaase yelides;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Minaasey Amoone yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Amooney Iyosiyaasa yelides,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyosiyaasi oyddu","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"attuma nayta yelides;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"bayrazi Yohanaane,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"iza kaaloti Iyo7aaqeme,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Sedeqiyaasanne Shaloome;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Iyo7aaqemey Ikoniyaanenne","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Sedeqiyaasa yelides.","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Kawo Ikoniyaane Nayta Zarkke"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["Baabiloone di7etti bida Ikoniyaane nayti Salatiyaale,"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["Malikraame, Paddaya, Shenaxaare, Yiqaamiya, Hoshamenne Nadabiya geetettizayta."]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Paddayay Zerubaabelenne Shim7e yelides; Zerubaabeleykka Mashulaame, Hanaaniyanne istta michcho Shalomito yelides."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["Qasseka hara ichchash attuma nayti izas deettes; heytikka Hashube, Ohele, Baraakaye, Hasadiyanne Yoshaabi-Hesside."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["Hanaaniyay Palaaxiyanne Yesha7iya geetettiza nam7u attuma nayta yelides; Yesha7iyaykka Erafaya yelides; Erafayay Ornaane yelides; Ornaaney Abdiyu yelides; Abdiyuy Shakaaniya yelides."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["Shakaaniyaykka Shama7e yelides; Shama7ey Haxushe, Yigi7aale, Baaryahe, Narayanne Saafaaxe geetettizayta 5 attuma nayta yelides; Shakaaniya zereththati kumeththi usuppuna."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["Narayay Elyo7enaye, Hizqiyaasanne Azirqaame geetettiza 3 attuma nayta yelides."]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["Elyo7enayey Hoddaye, Elyaasheebe, Pelaaya, Aqube, Yohanaane, Dallayanne Anaane geetettiza 7 attuma nayta yelides."]}],"footnotes":[]},"t